1
00:00:10,301 --> 00:00:13,138
‪THE LOVE LAB

2
00:00:13,722 --> 00:00:16,516
<i>‪On this final night,</i>
<i>‪we will now play Love Marble.</i>

3
00:00:16,599 --> 00:00:18,727
<i>‪"The rules of Love Marble."</i>

4
00:00:18,810 --> 00:00:22,147
<i>‪"Players take turns rolling the dice</i>

5
00:00:22,230 --> 00:00:24,274
<i>‪and move the number of spaces rolled."</i>

6
00:00:24,357 --> 00:00:27,569
<i>‪"You must complete the mission</i>
<i>‪on the space you land on."</i>

7
00:00:27,652 --> 00:00:30,697
<i>‪"Each player gets one pass."</i>

8
00:00:30,780 --> 00:00:32,073
‪-Cheers.
<i>‪-It's the last night.</i>

9
00:00:32,157 --> 00:00:34,617
‪-Really?
<i>‪-Find out how each other feel.</i>

10
00:00:35,285 --> 00:00:36,995
‪FIND OUT HOW YOU FEEL ABOUT EACH OTHER
‪ON THE FINAL NIGHT

11
00:00:37,120 --> 00:00:39,247
‪I thought, "Something's going
‪to happen tonight."

12
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:41,541
‪"It's all going down tonight."

13
00:00:41,624 --> 00:00:44,794
‪We were about to see the results
‪of everything that happened so far

14
00:00:44,878 --> 00:00:47,964
‪and get a sense of what's what.

15
00:00:48,047 --> 00:00:52,635
<i>‪I was curious to see</i>
<i>‪what Ga-yeon would decide.</i>

16
00:00:52,719 --> 00:00:54,846
<i>‪Even if I landed on a mission</i>
<i>‪to hold hands with someone,</i>

17
00:00:54,929 --> 00:00:57,432
<i>‪I wouldn't have anyone to choose,</i>

18
00:00:57,515 --> 00:00:58,975
<i>‪so I had mixed emotions.</i>

19
00:00:59,476 --> 00:01:01,561
‪We call it "sealing the deal," right?

20
00:01:01,644 --> 00:01:02,979
‪Since it was the last night,

21
00:01:03,063 --> 00:01:06,608
<i>‪I thought it might be a chance</i>
<i>‪to seal the deal with Ga-yeon</i>

22
00:01:06,691 --> 00:01:10,070
<i>‪and make it clear to the group as well.</i>

23
00:01:10,653 --> 00:01:13,740
<i>‪It was like a game of Truth.</i>
<i>‪It could put us in a tough spot.</i>

24
00:01:13,823 --> 00:01:15,992
<i>‪I saw what it says…</i>

25
00:01:16,076 --> 00:01:17,827
<i>‪We're really going to be in trouble</i>
<i>‪if we do this.</i>

26
00:01:17,911 --> 00:01:19,829
<i>‪I thought, "What do I do?"</i>
<i>‪I wasn't sure how I felt.</i>

27
00:01:20,580 --> 00:01:22,957
<i>‪-We will now begin playing Love Marble.</i>
<i>‪-Let's go!</i>

28
00:01:23,041 --> 00:01:24,125
‪LET'S BEGIN LOVE MARBLE

29
00:01:24,209 --> 00:01:26,252
‪Should we decide the order first?

30
00:01:26,336 --> 00:01:27,462
‪No, let the king decide.

31
00:01:28,046 --> 00:01:29,255
‪Let's go clockwise. I'll go first.

32
00:01:29,339 --> 00:01:30,423
‪-Okay.
‪-All right.

33
00:01:31,007 --> 00:01:33,259
‪DO-GEON

34
00:01:33,343 --> 00:01:35,553
‪-That's a six.
‪-This won't be easy.

35
00:01:35,637 --> 00:01:36,471
‪Yeah, the gray one.

36
00:01:36,554 --> 00:01:39,098
‪One, two, three, four, five, six.

37
00:01:39,182 --> 00:01:40,016
‪"Love Target Zone?"

38
00:01:40,099 --> 00:01:43,436
‪"Pick anyone you wish
‪and ask two questions."

39
00:01:44,437 --> 00:01:45,271
‪Pick one person?

40
00:01:45,355 --> 00:01:47,190
‪-Can I ask anything?
‪-One person would be too obvious,

41
00:01:47,273 --> 00:01:48,274
‪so pick two people.

42
00:01:48,358 --> 00:01:50,276
‪-Okay, one question each.
‪-Okay.

43
00:01:51,319 --> 00:01:53,446
‪I can't believe this is the first mission.

44
00:01:58,701 --> 00:01:59,536
‪Kyung-ho.

45
00:02:07,168 --> 00:02:08,503
‪Tell us

46
00:02:09,420 --> 00:02:12,132
‪who takes first place in your heart?

47
00:02:12,715 --> 00:02:13,967
‪-You want the reason?
‪-Yeah, that too.

48
00:02:18,847 --> 00:02:20,181
‪That's a good one.

49
00:02:20,265 --> 00:02:22,142
‪-Nice!
‪-Good going.

50
00:02:23,101 --> 00:02:25,270
<i>‪After talking to Ye-rim,</i>

51
00:02:25,353 --> 00:02:28,398
<i>‪I wanted to know how Kyung-ho felt.</i>

52
00:02:33,945 --> 00:02:35,321
‪It's Ga-yeon.

53
00:02:35,905 --> 00:02:37,699
‪-Why?
‪-My reason?

54
00:02:42,453 --> 00:02:44,539
<i>‪My heart dropped.</i>

55
00:02:44,622 --> 00:02:47,417
<i>‪I realized he wanted to show</i>
<i>‪he was serious about her.</i>

56
00:02:47,500 --> 00:02:48,585
‪What's your reason?

57
00:02:49,419 --> 00:02:50,253
‪I feel at ease with her.

58
00:02:51,963 --> 00:02:53,298
‪I need a drink.

59
00:02:54,966 --> 00:02:56,050
‪Seriously.

60
00:02:57,802 --> 00:02:58,803
‪-This is so fun.
‪-I love it.

61
00:02:58,887 --> 00:02:59,929
‪Yeah, it's so fun.

62
00:03:00,513 --> 00:03:02,223
‪-Okay.
‪-Cool.

63
00:03:02,307 --> 00:03:03,182
‪-Who next?
‪-Well played.

64
00:03:04,267 --> 00:03:05,810
‪-Jung-min.
‪-Yeah?

65
00:03:05,894 --> 00:03:08,605
‪Who is your current top pick, Jung-min?

66
00:03:08,688 --> 00:03:09,898
‪Mine is Ga-yeon.

67
00:03:10,481 --> 00:03:12,025
‪-What's your reason?
‪-My reason…

68
00:03:12,108 --> 00:03:13,359
‪There are too many reasons.

69
00:03:15,945 --> 00:03:20,575
‪But when we're together,
‪I don't feel awkward and I'm just myself.

70
00:03:21,659 --> 00:03:23,244
‪I feel like my true self comes out.

71
00:03:24,162 --> 00:03:26,372
‪-I feel totally at ease.
‪-Your reasons are so similar.

72
00:03:26,456 --> 00:03:27,498
‪Right? They're similar.

73
00:03:27,582 --> 00:03:29,792
‪I guess that's a part of Ga-yeon's charm.

74
00:03:30,293 --> 00:03:32,128
‪YE-RIM

75
00:03:32,712 --> 00:03:33,713
‪-Six.
‪-Six!

76
00:03:33,796 --> 00:03:35,465
‪LOVE TARGET ZONE

77
00:03:35,548 --> 00:03:37,258
‪-It's another six.
‪-Six keeps coming out.

78
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:39,761
‪We keep rolling sixes.

79
00:03:48,311 --> 00:03:50,188
‪I want to ask Ga-yeon.

80
00:03:50,271 --> 00:03:51,314
‪Who's your top pick?

81
00:03:52,106 --> 00:03:53,608
‪This is so fun.

82
00:03:53,691 --> 00:03:55,610
‪Hey, shall we get our drinks ready?

83
00:04:02,617 --> 00:04:04,827
‪-I have to answer, right?
‪-Yeah.

84
00:04:04,911 --> 00:04:06,704
‪-Or take a shot.
‪-But you have one pass.

85
00:04:06,788 --> 00:04:08,373
‪-Will she use it?
‪-Maybe.

86
00:04:09,374 --> 00:04:13,253
<i>‪I'm sure Ga-yeon will pick me.</i>

87
00:04:14,337 --> 00:04:16,005
‪I kind of want to pass.

88
00:04:19,259 --> 00:04:21,135
‪-I'll pass on this one.
‪-Okay.

89
00:04:21,219 --> 00:04:22,053
‪Sure.

90
00:04:24,347 --> 00:04:25,515
<i>‪That made me a bit uneasy.</i>

91
00:04:25,598 --> 00:04:29,394
<i>‪But I figured she didn't</i>
<i>‪want to upset Kyung-ho.</i>

92
00:04:30,270 --> 00:04:34,440
<i>‪I didn't want to share my feelings</i>
<i>‪in front of everyone.</i>

93
00:04:34,524 --> 00:04:37,026
<i>‪I just needed</i>
<i>‪to get out of that situation.</i>

94
00:04:38,569 --> 00:04:40,029
‪-Kyung-ho.
‪-Yes?

95
00:04:40,530 --> 00:04:42,740
‪How open is your heart right now,
‪percentage-wise?

96
00:04:49,330 --> 00:04:51,082
‪Do you get who I'm asking about?

97
00:04:51,666 --> 00:04:53,209
‪Can you ask the question one more time?

98
00:04:53,293 --> 00:04:54,711
‪How open is your heart, percentage-wise?

99
00:04:54,794 --> 00:04:55,795
‪Open to who?

100
00:04:55,878 --> 00:04:57,463
‪Who else would it be?

101
00:04:58,214 --> 00:05:00,883
‪That's why I'm going this far
‪to explain myself.

102
00:05:00,967 --> 00:05:04,012
‪I want you to open up to me
‪just a little bit more.

103
00:05:06,180 --> 00:05:08,141
‪Okay. I won't close the door on you.

104
00:05:24,490 --> 00:05:25,408
‪Thirty percent?

105
00:05:28,077 --> 00:05:30,163
<i>‪He said he was 30 percent open.</i>

106
00:05:30,246 --> 00:05:36,669
<i>‪I think I was hoping he'd pick me</i>
<i>‪at least once.</i>

107
00:05:36,753 --> 00:05:38,463
‪GA-YEON

108
00:05:38,546 --> 00:05:39,797
‪-Two.
‪-What's it say?

109
00:05:39,881 --> 00:05:41,132
‪-Gosh.
‪-I can't see.

110
00:05:41,215 --> 00:05:42,175
‪-I'll read it.
‪-It's intense.

111
00:05:42,258 --> 00:05:44,302
‪"Say something flirty and do a love shot

112
00:05:44,385 --> 00:05:46,054
‪with someone you gave
‪Heart Chips to yesterday,

113
00:05:46,137 --> 00:05:49,974
‪or say something flirty and feed a snack
‪to the person you're interested in."

114
00:05:50,683 --> 00:05:51,684
‪That's a fun one.

115
00:05:55,730 --> 00:05:57,106
‪A snack?

116
00:05:57,190 --> 00:05:59,984
‪Which one are you choosing?

117
00:06:00,068 --> 00:06:02,653
‪A DRINK WITH ONE YOU GAVE HEARTS TO
‪OR A SNACK FOR ONE YOU'RE INTERESTED IN

118
00:06:02,737 --> 00:06:06,699
‪I'll say something flirty and feed a snack
‪to the guy I'm interested in.

119
00:06:06,783 --> 00:06:07,700
‪-Okay.
‪-All right.

120
00:06:19,128 --> 00:06:20,296
‪Oh, man.

121
00:06:21,255 --> 00:06:23,674
‪I think I'm interested in you.

122
00:06:25,676 --> 00:06:28,054
‪-I see.
‪-That's how it is.

123
00:06:28,888 --> 00:06:30,765
‪-Right.
‪-I see.

124
00:06:30,848 --> 00:06:32,934
‪I need soju. Can you pour me a shot?

125
00:06:33,017 --> 00:06:34,268
‪You look so down.

126
00:06:34,352 --> 00:06:35,812
‪You must be craving some soju.

127
00:06:36,604 --> 00:06:37,605
‪-Who's next?
‪-Next.

128
00:06:40,942 --> 00:06:42,985
‪-It's getting serious.
‪-He's looking darker.

129
00:06:43,069 --> 00:06:44,654
‪-That face should've come sooner.
‪-You know…

130
00:06:44,737 --> 00:06:46,114
<i>‪I went over it again in my mind.</i>

131
00:06:46,197 --> 00:06:49,534
‪If I were her
‪and Jung-min were my first choice,

132
00:06:49,617 --> 00:06:52,120
‪I'd have picked the person
‪I gave the Heart Chips to.

133
00:06:52,203 --> 00:06:53,579
‪Since she gave them to me.

134
00:06:53,663 --> 00:06:56,207
‪The more I thought about it,
‪her picking Kyung-ho made no sense.

135
00:06:59,127 --> 00:07:00,503
<i>‪I wondered if she was still conflicted.</i>

136
00:07:01,671 --> 00:07:06,050
<i>‪I thought I should choose the guy</i>
<i>‪I felt more drawn to at that moment.</i>

137
00:07:06,134 --> 00:07:08,052
<i>‪It was really tough.</i>

138
00:07:08,719 --> 00:07:10,513
‪HA-YOON

139
00:07:12,056 --> 00:07:14,559
‪"A nice drink with the person
‪you gave Black Hearts to."

140
00:07:16,102 --> 00:07:17,228
‪Let's take a shot, Do-geon.

141
00:07:18,563 --> 00:07:19,605
‪Are you serious?

142
00:07:19,689 --> 00:07:21,023
‪-How come?
‪-Wow.

143
00:07:21,107 --> 00:07:22,900
‪I had my reasons.

144
00:07:23,651 --> 00:07:26,028
‪AS PART OF THE PLOT,
‪HA-YOON GAVE BLACK HEARTS TO DO-GEON

145
00:07:26,112 --> 00:07:28,406
‪Is that so? I get it.

146
00:07:28,489 --> 00:07:29,782
‪-I'm sorry.
‪-"I had my reasons."

147
00:07:29,866 --> 00:07:31,033
‪I understand.

148
00:07:31,117 --> 00:07:32,702
‪-I'm sorry. You know that, right?
‪-But why?

149
00:07:32,785 --> 00:07:36,456
‪I had no choice but to use
‪Black Hearts on Do-geon.

150
00:07:36,539 --> 00:07:38,583
‪-Here I go.
‪-I was so surprised.

151
00:07:38,666 --> 00:07:39,625
‪JUNG-MIN

152
00:07:40,376 --> 00:07:41,419
‪It's a new mission.

153
00:07:42,170 --> 00:07:44,797
‪ASK THE PERSON YOU THINK GAVE YOU
‪HEART CHIPS TO FEED YOU A SNACK

154
00:07:44,881 --> 00:07:46,257
‪-Read it out loud.
‪-Feed me, too.

155
00:07:47,925 --> 00:07:49,260
‪-What?
‪-Come on.

156
00:07:49,343 --> 00:07:50,887
‪-Read it out loud first.
‪-Oh, please.

157
00:07:50,970 --> 00:07:54,640
‪"Ask the person you think gave you
‪Heart Chips to feed you a snack."

158
00:07:58,019 --> 00:07:58,853
‪Oh, gosh.

159
00:07:58,936 --> 00:08:00,396
‪The snacks are selling like crazy.

160
00:08:02,982 --> 00:08:04,734
‪-She's feeding a lot of mouths.
‪-Mother bird.

161
00:08:05,234 --> 00:08:06,152
‪Next.

162
00:08:08,154 --> 00:08:11,657
<i>‪I partly did it to loosen up a bit.</i>

163
00:08:12,283 --> 00:08:15,036
<i>‪But my head's a mess, honestly.</i>

164
00:08:15,119 --> 00:08:17,371
‪HYE-WON

165
00:08:18,206 --> 00:08:20,500
‪"Share your most exciting moment
‪since you got here."

166
00:08:24,754 --> 00:08:25,922
‪There was a time

167
00:08:26,547 --> 00:08:28,966
‪when no one picked me.

168
00:08:29,050 --> 00:08:31,427
‪But then I got a text

169
00:08:33,638 --> 00:08:34,931
<i>‪about a camping date.</i>

170
00:08:35,014 --> 00:08:36,307
‪I'm going.

171
00:08:36,390 --> 00:08:37,725
<i>‪So I ran out right away.</i>

172
00:08:37,808 --> 00:08:38,976
<i>‪-That was the moment?</i>
<i>‪-Yeah.</i>

173
00:08:39,477 --> 00:08:41,604
‪The time your knight in shining armor
‪came to the rescue?

174
00:08:41,687 --> 00:08:42,605
‪When I went to see him.

175
00:08:45,566 --> 00:08:47,318
‪Ha-yoon's face just now…

176
00:08:47,401 --> 00:08:48,653
‪Did he give birth to her?

177
00:08:48,736 --> 00:08:49,612
‪Is he her dad?

178
00:08:49,695 --> 00:08:50,947
‪"Does she mean me?"

179
00:08:51,572 --> 00:08:53,741
‪The time your knight in shining armor
‪came to the rescue?

180
00:08:53,824 --> 00:08:54,784
‪When I went to see him.

181
00:08:56,202 --> 00:09:00,331
‪CHAE-RIN

182
00:09:00,414 --> 00:09:02,583
‪-Three.
‪-What's it say? Read it out.

183
00:09:02,667 --> 00:09:05,836
‪"Whisper one thing to the person
‪you gave Heart Chips to yesterday."

184
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:08,631
‪-"The person chosen must respond."
‪-They have to reply.

185
00:09:08,714 --> 00:09:09,882
‪Unbelievable.

186
00:09:15,137 --> 00:09:16,013
‪Okay.

187
00:09:23,104 --> 00:09:24,272
‪Can you guys hear?

188
00:09:24,355 --> 00:09:26,023
‪Let's make noise for them.

189
00:09:26,107 --> 00:09:27,817
‪Slightly bang the table.

190
00:09:29,485 --> 00:09:30,861
‪Call me <i>‪nuna</i>‪.

191
00:09:35,491 --> 00:09:36,492
‪You have to respond.

192
00:09:39,161 --> 00:09:40,162
<i>‪Nuna.</i>

193
00:09:42,748 --> 00:09:44,292
‪Why is she so excited?

194
00:09:44,375 --> 00:09:46,627
‪-Because she's in love.
‪-She's so excited.

195
00:09:47,628 --> 00:09:48,629
<i>‪Nuna.</i>

196
00:09:49,839 --> 00:09:51,132
‪-Are you happy?
‪-Yeah.

197
00:09:51,215 --> 00:09:52,383
‪There you go.

198
00:09:52,466 --> 00:09:54,051
<i>‪On my first date with Do-geon,</i>

199
00:09:54,135 --> 00:09:55,970
‪I told him to call me <i>‪nuna</i>‪.

200
00:09:56,053 --> 00:09:57,138
‪Call me<i>‪ nuna</i>‪.

201
00:09:58,556 --> 00:09:59,682
‪Come on.

202
00:10:02,143 --> 00:10:03,978
<i>‪He looked at me like, "Not a chance."</i>

203
00:10:04,061 --> 00:10:05,605
<i>‪So ever since then,</i>

204
00:10:05,688 --> 00:10:07,648
<i>‪I was determined to make him say it.</i>

205
00:10:07,732 --> 00:10:09,066
‪"Call me <i>‪nuna</i>‪."

206
00:10:12,445 --> 00:10:14,071
<i>‪It was seriously so much fun.</i>

207
00:10:14,864 --> 00:10:16,449
‪YE-RIM

208
00:10:17,033 --> 00:10:18,200
‪-She's good.
‪-It's another six.

209
00:10:18,284 --> 00:10:19,118
‪She might win…

210
00:10:19,201 --> 00:10:20,411
‪Four, five, six.

211
00:10:23,080 --> 00:10:24,665
‪-Need to sigh?
‪-That spot…

212
00:10:27,126 --> 00:10:28,836
‪MOVE TO THE SEAT
‪NEXT TO THE PERSON YOU LIKE!

213
00:10:28,919 --> 00:10:30,838
‪"Move to the seat
‪next to the person you like."

214
00:10:31,464 --> 00:10:32,465
‪Next to them?

215
00:10:40,139 --> 00:10:42,016
‪Change seats with Ga-yeon.

216
00:10:42,099 --> 00:10:44,018
‪-Just switch.
‪-Switch.

217
00:10:47,521 --> 00:10:48,939
‪-Want to switch seats with me?
‪-Sure.

218
00:10:53,027 --> 00:10:54,195
‪Welcome.

219
00:10:54,862 --> 00:10:56,364
‪I feel a bit dizzy.

220
00:10:56,447 --> 00:10:57,573
‪She's back to her feeble self.

221
00:10:57,657 --> 00:10:59,075
‪The feeble princess is back.

222
00:10:59,158 --> 00:11:00,660
‪Okay!

223
00:11:02,995 --> 00:11:05,373
<i>‪Honestly, I really hesitated</i>

224
00:11:05,456 --> 00:11:09,168
<i>‪because he was making</i>
<i>‪his feelings so obvious.</i>

225
00:11:09,251 --> 00:11:11,587
